WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.930
- See, Collectivists see
the State as the source

00:00:01.930 --> 00:00:03.940
of our morals, and our
families as obstacles

00:00:03.940 --> 00:00:05.940
standing between individuals
and their master.

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:07.530
That's exactly what's
happening with Alfie Evans,

00:00:07.530 --> 00:00:08.520
where bureaucrats are standing

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:09.780
between parents and their child,

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:12.390
saying that they know best
that a child has to die,

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:15.320
because they know better
than the parents do.

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:16.153
Collectivists,

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:20.630
there's a reason that Karl Marx abhorred

00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:22.490
the traditional family,
let's just say that.

00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:24.160
He saw it as a Capitalist institution

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:25.870
based on capital and on private gain.

00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:28.420
He openly called for
abolition of the family.

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:30.470
There's a reason Stalin
trained Soviet youth

00:00:30.470 --> 00:00:32.580
to become pioneers, that's
what he called them,

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:34.180
emissaries of the State who were told

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:35.050
that the highest good involves

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:37.250
ratting out your own family members.

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:39.760
At 1932 Soviet trial, a
father actually cried out

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:41.190
to his son, "It's me, your father,"

00:00:41.190 --> 00:00:43.800
and the son replied, "Yes,
he used to be my father,

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:45.760
but I no longer consider him my father.

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:47.930
I'm not acting as a
son, but as a pioneer."

00:00:47.930 --> 00:00:50.290
Stalin used to go around Soviet Russia

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:51.760
talking about this story, and using it

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:53.700
as an example of good behavior.

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:54.810
Hey, breaking down the family

00:00:54.810 --> 00:00:56.960
is a precondition to
building up the State.

